    ],
    "lat": 32.7194586,
    "lng": -117.1735913,
    "description": "<p>Formerly the old Ketch Grill and Taps of the Portside Pier, this public viewing access bar and eatery is my go to for chill vibes, good company, and the perfect San Diego Summer sunset spot.</p><h3>The order</h3><ul><li>SPICY CHICKEN SANDWICH&nbsp;</li><li>Burger — solid, nothing more needs to be said</li><li>Whatever is on draft — rotating, usually local</li></ul><p>Patio seating is the move. Arrive before sunset if you want a spot.</p>",
